        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Fulton, Billy Wright\n- Organizations: Loyalist Volunteer Force, Irish National Liberation Army\n- Places: Maze Prison, Northern Ireland\n- Events: The Troubles, assassination of Billy Wright in 1997\n\nFacts:\n- Billy Wright was born on 7 July 1960 and died on 27 December 1997.\n- Billy Wright was a prominent Ulster loyalist during the Troubles in Northern Ireland.\n- In 1997, members of the Irish National Liberation Army assassinated Billy Wright in the Maze Prison.\n- After Billy Wright's assassination in 1997, Mark Fulton took over command of the Loyalist Volunteer Force.\n- Mark Fulton was the leader of the Loyalist Volunteer Force.",
